        "minimality": "3 irreducible components (disc, sampler, perceived image) + 3 drivers (ω, f_s, φ) ✅",
        "emergence": "Perceived regime (freeze/reversal) is emergent from the beat of two rates — not present in either alone ✅",
        "verifiability": "Directly checkable by the reader's own perception ✅",
        "attractorHonesty": "Documented weak A — no convergence state; freeze points belong to the perception, not the disc ✅"
